      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To clarify, the intention would be to allow a desktop player to send a billboard chat to the targeted avatar, not present it in-world. Another option could be to simply add in a DIKU-style or mmo game style chat window, where the usual \"channels\" can exist (i.e., world, whisper, etc). \n\nAlso, it occurs that a small indicator that a particular avatar doesn't have VR, doesn't have a mic, or simply \"is using chat\" might be helpful.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
